{"id":"6226ed6b29249a1a","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md","title":"ZFC Filter6 Filter On Set","display":"df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set — ZFC Filter6 Filter On Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set"],"display":"df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set — ZFC Filter6 Filter On Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set — ZFC Filter6 Filter On Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter6\\text{-}filter\\text{-}on\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land X\\in\\mathcal F\\land \\emptyset\\notin\\mathcal F\\land \\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal F\\;(A\\cap B\\in\\mathcal F)\\land \\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;(A\\subseteq B\\to B\\in\\mathcal F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter6\\text{-}filter\\text{-}on\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land X\\in\\mathcal F\\land \\emptyset\\notin\\mathcal F\\land \\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal F\\;(A\\cap B\\in\\mathcal F)\\land \\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;(A\\subseteq B\\to B\\in\\mathcal F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Proper set filter; this is distinct from a forcing filter on a poset.</li>\n<li>The subset variables <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> are bound in the assertion and are no longer duplicated as free hypothesis parameters.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter6\\text{-}filter\\text{-}on\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land X\\in\\mathcal F\\land \\emptyset\\notin\\mathcal F\\land \\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal F\\;(A\\cap B\\in\\mathcal F)\\land \\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;(A\\subseteq B\\to B\\in\\mathcal F)","display":true},{"tex":"A,B","display":false}],"bytes":998,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca566714b52a0471","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S$ is the proper set-filter predicate (see [[../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md]])"},{"id":"7f0